n_factor); let cadence_frozen = cadence_temp_factor <= 0.0;`. The code uses the configured parameter directly. When `temp_condition_min_factor = 0.0` and the temperature factor is also zero or negative, `cadence_frozen` becomes true, correctly halting molt progression."},{"amendment_id":"fr-12-e7fe9284","decision":"reject","rationale":"The diagnostic mismatch does not exist. `emit_molt_failure` already computes `gh_ratio` as `Option<f64>`, returning `None` when `params.gh_min_d == 0.0` (lines 1385-1389). The critical-GH detail is only emitted at line 1445 via `gh_ratio.filter(|_| critical_gh_failure)`, which evaluates to `None` when `gh_min_d == 0.0`. The event stream is already truthful for zero-GH-floor configurations."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"561636b4-7c24-41a3-aad1-eb3612e025fe"}
